            "explanationHinglish": "Nishaan hain 3.71, 3.72, …, 3.79. 3.76 < 3.765 < 3.77, to ye 3.76 aur 3.77 ke beech hai. Agle zoom mein is hisse ko 10 bhaagon mein baanto, aur 3.765 5th nishaan par milega."
