            "body": "Topic 3 mein humne ek nayi duniya dekhi: **irrational numbers**. Aise numbers jinka decimal kabhi khatam nahi hota aur kabhi repeat bhi nahi hota, jaise √2, √3 aur π. Humne ye bhi dekha ki rational aur irrational milkar **real numbers** banate hain, aur number line ka har point ek real number hai.\n\nAb sawaal ye hai: in numbers ke saath **kaam** kaise karein? Agar ek rational aur ek irrational ko jodo, to kya milega? √50 jaise number ko chhota kaise likhein? Aur √5 jaisa number number line par kahan baithega? Is topic mein hum yahi seekhenge.",
