            "explanationHinglish": "72 ka sabse bada perfect square factor 36 hai, to √72 = √36 × √2 = 6√2. Jaanch: (6√2)² = 36 × 2 = 72. Agar 2√18 par ruk gaye, to wo poora simplify nahi hua."
