            "body": "Socho aap auto mein baithte ho. Auto wala bolta hai:\n\n\"Meter down hote hi **₹30** lagenge, aur uske baad har kilometre ke **₹12**.\"\n\nAb sawal ye hai ki aapko kitna dena padega?\n\n- Agar aap 1 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 1 = ₹42\n- Agar aap 5 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 5 = ₹90\n- Agar aap 10 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 10 = ₹150\n\nDhyan do, **₹30 har baar wahi raha**, chahe aap 1 km gaye ya 10 km. Par **kilometre badalte rahe**, aur unke saath kiraya bhi badalta raha.\n\nAb agar hum kilometre ko ek letter **x** bana dein, to kiraya aise likh sakte hain:\n\n**Kiraya = 30 + 12x**\n\nBas, aapne abhi abhi apni pehli algebraic expression likh di. Is topic mein hum yahi seekhenge: ye 30 kya hai, ye x kya hai, aur ye poori cheez kya kehlati hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Socho aap auto mein baithte ho. Auto wala bolta hai:\n\n\"Meter down hote hi **₹30** lagenge, aur uske baad har kilometre ke **₹12**.\"\n\nAb sawal ye hai ki aapko kitna dena padega?\n\n- Agar aap 1 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 1 = ₹42\n- Agar aap 5 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 5 = ₹90\n- Agar aap 10 km gaye: 30 + 12 × 10 = ₹150\n\nDhyan do, **₹30 har baar wahi raha**, chahe aap 1 km gaye ya 10 km. Par **kilometre badalte rahe**, aur unke saath kiraya bhi badalta raha.\n\nAb agar hum kilometre ko ek letter **x** bana dein, to kiraya aise likh sakte hain:\n\n**Kiraya = 30 + 12x**\n\nBas, aapne abhi abhi apni pehli algebraic expression likh di. Is topic mein hum yahi seekhenge: ye 30 kya hai, ye x kya hai, aur ye poori cheez kya kehlati hai."
