            "headingHinglish": "Part F: Real-life mein terms aur factors",
            "body": "Ek shop ka bill dekho:\n\n- 4 notebooks, har ek ₹n ka\n- 3 pens, har ek ₹p ka\n- 1 school bag, ₹250 ka\n\nKul bill = **4n + 3p + 250**\n\n| Term | Kya dikha raha hai | Factors |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4n | Notebooks ka kharcha | 4 (kitni), n (rate) |\n| 3p | Pens ka kharcha | 3 (kitne), p (rate) |\n| 250 | Bag ka kharcha | sirf number |\n\nYahan har item ka alag kharcha ek **term** hai, aur har kharche ke andar \"kitni cheezein\" × \"ek ka rate\" ek term ke **factors** hain.\n\nEk aur example. Rectangle ka area aur perimeter jodna ho:\n**lb + 2l + 2b**\n- Terms: lb, 2l, 2b (3 terms)\n- lb ke factors: l aur b\n- 2l ke factors: 2 aur l",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ek shop ka bill dekho:\n\n- 4 notebooks, har ek ₹n ka\n- 3 pens, har ek ₹p ka\n- 1 school bag, ₹250 ka\n\nKul bill = **4n + 3p + 250**\n\n| Term | Kya dikha raha hai | Factors |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4n | Notebooks ka kharcha | 4 (kitni), n (rate) |\n| 3p | Pens ka kharcha | 3 (kitne), p (rate) |\n| 250 | Bag ka kharcha | sirf number |\n\nYahan har item ka alag kharcha ek **term** hai, aur har kharche ke andar \"kitni cheezein\" × \"ek ka rate\" ek term ke **factors** hain.\n\nEk aur example. Rectangle ka area aur perimeter jodna ho:\n**lb + 2l + 2b**\n- Terms: lb, 2l, 2b (3 terms)\n- lb ke factors: l aur b\n- 2l ke factors: 2 aur l"
