            "body": "**Galti 1: Terms aur factors ko mix karna**\n3x + 5 mein 3x aur 5 **terms** hain. 3x ke andar 3 aur x **factors** hain. Terms ko + / - alag karte hain, factors ko × jodta hai.\n\n**Galti 2: Minus sign chhod dena**\nx² - 4x + 1 mein doosra term -4x hai, 4x nahi.\n\n**Galti 3: Bracket ke andar ke terms ko alag gin lena**\n3(a + b) jaise likha hai ek term hai. Bracket kholne ke baad hi 3a aur 3b alag terms bante hain.\n\n**Galti 4: Coefficient sirf number samajhna**\n\"Coefficient of x in 5xy\" ka answer 5 nahi, **5y** hai. Sirf numerical coefficient pooche to hi 5.\n\n**Galti 5: Variable ka coefficient 0 samajhna**\nAgar sirf x likha ho to x ka coefficient **1** hota hai. -x ka coefficient **-1** hota hai.\n\n**Galti 6: Constant term mein factor na dhundna**\nConstant term 7 ka bhi numerical factor 7 hota hai. Bas isme koi letter factor nahi hota.",
