            "bodyHinglish": "- **Term** ko + aur - alag karte hain. **Factors** ko × jodta hai.\n- Term ke andar ka number **numerical factor** (ya numerical coefficient) kehlata hai, aur letters **literal factors**.\n- **Kisi factor ka coefficient** = term ke baaki saare factors ka product.\n- Sign term ke saath chipka hota hai (-3b ek term hai, 3b nahi).\n- Bracket khulne se pehle bracket wala hissa ek term hota hai. Khulne ke baad naye terms bante hain.\n- x/2 + y/3 mein 2 terms hain, par (x + y)/2 jaise likha hai ek term hai.\n- Terms ko descending ya ascending order mein arrange kar sakte hain (sign ke saath)."
