            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Polynomials chapter mein humne dekha tha ki **terms** kya hote hain aur **like terms** ko kaise jodte hain (jaise 3x + 5x = 8x). Wahan ek chhota sa kaam bhi kiya tha: ek term ko bracket se multiply karna, jaise 2x(x + 3) = 2x² + 6x.\n\nAb ek kadam aage chalte hain. Kya hoga jab **do brackets** aapas mein multiply hon? Jaise (x + 3)(x + 5), ya (a + b)². Isi ko **expansion** kehte hain. Aur is topic mein hum chaar aise formulas seekhenge jo maths ke sabse zyada kaam aane wale formulas mein se hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Polynomials chapter mein humne dekha tha ki **terms** kya hote hain aur **like terms** ko kaise jodte hain (jaise 3x + 5x = 8x). Wahan ek chhota sa kaam bhi kiya tha: ek term ko bracket se multiply karna, jaise 2x(x + 3) = 2x² + 6x.\n\nAb ek kadam aage chalte hain. Kya hoga jab **do brackets** aapas mein multiply hon? Jaise (x + 3)(x + 5), ya (a + b)². Isi ko **expansion** kehte hain. Aur is topic mein hum chaar aise formulas seekhenge jo maths ke sabse zyada kaam aane wale formulas mein se hain."
