            "body": "Shehar ke TV channel par ek quiz show aata hai: **\"Dimaag ka Dhamaka\"**. Is baar ki champion hai Class 9 ki **Ananya**.\n\nHost ne poocha: \"Ananya, **102 ka square** batao. Calculator nahi chalega!\"\n\nAnanya ne do second socha aur boli: \"**10404**.\"\n\nHost hairaan. \"Itni jaldi kaise?\"\n\nAnanya muskurai: \"Sir, 102 matlab 100 + 2. Main 100 ka square leti hoon (10000), 2 ka square leti hoon (4), aur beech mein **2 × 100 × 2 = 400** jodti hoon. Bas: 10000 + 400 + 4 = **10404**.\"\n\nPhir host ne poocha: \"**103 × 97**?\"\n\nAnanya: \"**9991**. Kyunki ye (100 + 3)(100 − 3) hai, to bas 100² − 3² = 10000 − 9.\"\n\nAudience ne taaliyan bajayin. Par Ananya ke paas koi jaadu nahi tha. Uske paas bas **chaar formulas** the, jinhe hum is topic mein seekhenge. Ye formulas sirf numbers ke liye nahi, poore algebra ke liye kaam aate hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Shehar ke TV channel par ek quiz show aata hai: **\"Dimaag ka Dhamaka\"**. Is baar ki champion hai Class 9 ki **Ananya**.\n\nHost ne poocha: \"Ananya, **102 ka square** batao. Calculator nahi chalega!\"\n\nAnanya ne do second socha aur boli: \"**10404**.\"\n\nHost hairaan. \"Itni jaldi kaise?\"\n\nAnanya muskurai: \"Sir, 102 matlab 100 + 2. Main 100 ka square leti hoon (10000), 2 ka square leti hoon (4), aur beech mein **2 × 100 × 2 = 400** jodti hoon. Bas: 10000 + 400 + 4 = **10404**.\"\n\nPhir host ne poocha: \"**103 × 97**?\"\n\nAnanya: \"**9991**. Kyunki ye (100 + 3)(100 − 3) hai, to bas 100² − 3² = 10000 − 9.\"\n\nAudience ne taaliyan bajayin. Par Ananya ke paas koi jaadu nahi tha. Uske paas bas **chaar formulas** the, jinhe hum is topic mein seekhenge. Ye formulas sirf numbers ke liye nahi, poore algebra ke liye kaam aate hain."
