            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne brackets ko kholna seekha tha. (a + b)², (a − b)², (a + b)(a − b) aur (x + a)(x + b) ko area wali picture se samjha, bahut saare expansions kiye, aur 102² ya 103 × 97 jaise sawaal mann mein hal kiye.\n\nAb hum in identities ka ek naya kaam dekhenge. Kabhi kabhi humein **a aur b khud pata nahi hote**, sirf unke baare mein kuch baatein pata hoti hain, jaise unka jod aur guna. Phir bhi identities ki madad se hum a² + b², (a − b)² jaisi cheezein nikaal sakte hain, **bina a aur b dhundhe**. Yahi is topic ka jaadu hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne brackets ko kholna seekha tha. (a + b)², (a − b)², (a + b)(a − b) aur (x + a)(x + b) ko area wali picture se samjha, bahut saare expansions kiye, aur 102² ya 103 × 97 jaise sawaal mann mein hal kiye.\n\nAb hum in identities ka ek naya kaam dekhenge. Kabhi kabhi humein **a aur b khud pata nahi hote**, sirf unke baare mein kuch baatein pata hoti hain, jaise unka jod aur guna. Phir bhi identities ki madad se hum a² + b², (a − b)² jaisi cheezein nikaal sakte hain, **bina a aur b dhundhe**. Yahi is topic ka jaadu hai."
