            "heading": "Quick Recap",
            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- Topic 1 ki do identities se hi saare naye results nikalte hain. Kuch ratne ki zaroorat nahi.\n- **a² + b² = (a + b)² − 2ab = (a − b)² + 2ab**\n- **(a + b)² − (a − b)² = 4ab**\n- **(a + b)² + (a − b)² = 2(a² + b²)**\n- **(a − b)² = (a + b)² − 4ab**\n- Square root lete waqt **±** lagao, kyunki 3² aur (−3)² dono 9 hain.\n- **(x + 1/x)² = x² + 1/x² + 2** aur **(x − 1/x)² = x² + 1/x² − 2**, kyunki x · (1/x) = 1.\n- x⁴ + 1/x⁴ ke liye x² + 1/x² ko square karke 2 ghatao.\n- a² ± 2ab + b² jaisi shakal dikhe to seedha (a ± b)² likh do. Decimals ka kaam aasan ho jata hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- Topic 1 ki do identities se hi saare naye results nikalte hain. Kuch ratne ki zaroorat nahi.\n- **a² + b² = (a + b)² − 2ab = (a − b)² + 2ab**\n- **(a + b)² − (a − b)² = 4ab**\n- **(a + b)² + (a − b)² = 2(a² + b²)**\n- **(a − b)² = (a + b)² − 4ab**\n- Square root lete waqt **±** lagao, kyunki 3² aur (−3)² dono 9 hain.\n- **(x + 1/x)² = x² + 1/x² + 2** aur **(x − 1/x)² = x² + 1/x² − 2**, kyunki x · (1/x) = 1.\n- x⁴ + 1/x⁴ ke liye x² + 1/x² ko square karke 2 ghatao.\n- a² ± 2ab + b² jaisi shakal dikhe to seedha (a ± b)² likh do. Decimals ka kaam aasan ho jata hai."
