            "body": "Topic 3 mein humne teen terms wale bracket ka square kholna seekha tha, (a + b + c)², jahan har term ka square aur har jodi ka \"2 guna product\" aata tha. Pooja ki rangoli yaad hai? 7 × 7 ka square 9 tukdon mein bata tha: 3 chhote squares aur 6 rectangles. Usse pehle Topic 1 mein do terms ka square, (a + b)², aur Topic 2 mein uske saath values nikalna dekha tha.\n\nAb hum wapas **do terms** par aate hain, par power badhaate hain: **2 ki jagah 3**. Yaani bracket ko teen baar multiply karna. Ghabraiye mat, iska bhi ek pakka pattern hai, aur Topic 1 wala square hi yahan seedhi ka pehla dandaa banega.",
