            "heading": "Part G: Kaunsi identity lagegi? (poore chapter ka revision)",
            "headingHinglish": "Part G: Kaunsi identity lagegi? (poore chapter ka revision)",
            "body": "Kisi bhi expression ko dekh kar pehle pehchano ki kaunsa pattern hai:\n\n| Expression | Pattern | Topic |\n|---|---|---|\n| (x + 5)² | (a + b)² | Topic 1 |\n| (2a − 3)(2a + 3) | (a + b)(a − b) | Topic 1 |\n| (x + 4)(x − 7) | (x + a)(x + b) | Topic 1 |\n| (p + q + r)² | (a + b + c)² | Topic 3 |\n| (y − 2)³ | (a − b)³ | Topic 4 |\n| (m + 1)(m² − m + 1) | sum of cubes wala product | Topic 5 |\n| (x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3) | teen binomials | Topic 5 |\n\n**Pehchanne ki trick:**\n- Ek hi bracket ki power 2 ya 3 → square ya cube wali identity.\n- Do brackets jinme sirf beech ka sign alag → (a + b)(a − b).\n- Ek chhota bracket (2 terms) aur ek bada bracket (3 terms jisme square + product + square) → Part A ya B.\n- 3 terms ka bracket × 6 terms ka bracket → Part C.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Kisi bhi expression ko dekh kar pehle pehchano ki kaunsa pattern hai:\n\n| Expression | Pattern | Topic |\n|---|---|---|\n| (x + 5)² | (a + b)² | Topic 1 |\n| (2a − 3)(2a + 3) | (a + b)(a − b) | Topic 1 |\n| (x + 4)(x − 7) | (x + a)(x + b) | Topic 1 |\n| (p + q + r)² | (a + b + c)² | Topic 3 |\n| (y − 2)³ | (a − b)³ | Topic 4 |\n| (m + 1)(m² − m + 1) | sum of cubes wala product | Topic 5 |\n| (x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3) | teen binomials | Topic 5 |\n\n**Pehchanne ki trick:**\n- Ek hi bracket ki power 2 ya 3 → square ya cube wali identity.\n- Do brackets jinme sirf beech ka sign alag → (a + b)(a − b).\n- Ek chhota bracket (2 terms) aur ek bada bracket (3 terms jisme square + product + square) → Part A ya B.\n- 3 terms ka bracket × 6 terms ka bracket → Part C."
