            "body": "Pichle topic mein humne word problems ka **4-step method** seekha tha: unknowns ko naam do, sentences se equations banao, solve karo, aur ant mein **words mein wapas jaanch** karo. Wahan numbers, ages, fractions aur digits ke sawaal the, jaise Sonpur mela mein Bani ki jod 50, antar 12 wali paheli (31 aur 19). Ab wahi method hum paise ke bills, gaadiyon ki race, nadi mein chalti naav aur geometry ki shapes par lagayenge. Naya kuch nahi seekhna: bas \"kaun sa sentence kaun si equation banata hai\", ye dekhne ki nazar aur tez karni hai. Aur ye chapter ka aakhri topic hai, to end mein poore chapter ka wrap-up bhi milega.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichle topic mein humne word problems ka **4-step method** seekha tha: unknowns ko naam do, sentences se equations banao, solve karo, aur ant mein **words mein wapas jaanch** karo. Wahan numbers, ages, fractions aur digits ke sawaal the, jaise Sonpur mela mein Bani ki jod 50, antar 12 wali paheli (31 aur 19). Ab wahi method hum paise ke bills, gaadiyon ki race, nadi mein chalti naav aur geometry ki shapes par lagayenge. Naya kuch nahi seekhna: bas \"kaun sa sentence kaun si equation banata hai\", ye dekhne ki nazar aur tez karni hai. Aur ye chapter ka aakhri topic hai, to end mein poore chapter ka wrap-up bhi milega."
