            "body": "Socho aap aaj se lagbhag 5000 saal pehle Misr (Egypt) mein ek kisaan ho. Aapka khet **Nile nadi** ke kinare hai.\n\nHar saal baarish ke mausam mein Nile mein baadh aati hai. Paani utarta hai to khet ki saari mitti ek jaisi ho jati hai. Aapke khet ki seema (boundary) ke nishaan bhi beh jaate hain. Ab aapka khet kahan khatam hota hai aur padosi ka kahan shuru, kisi ko pata nahi.\n\nJhagda na ho, isliye raja ke log aate hain. Unke haath mein **gaanth lagi rassi** hoti hai. Wo rassi khinch kar khet ko dobara naapte hain, aur har kisaan ko uska hissa wapas dete hain.\n\nIsi zameen naapne ke kaam se ek naya vishay paida hua: **Geometry**.\n\n- **Geo** = dharti (earth)\n- **Metron** = naapna (measure)\n\nYaani **geometry = dharti ko naapna.**\n\nPar aaj ki geometry sirf khet naapna nahi hai. Is chapter mein hum dekhenge ki kaise ek Greek teacher, **Euclid**, ne geometry ko ek aisi shakal di jo 2000 saal se zyada se school mein padhai ja rahi hai. Uska raaz tha kuch **bahut simple baatein** jinhe sab maan lete hain, aur unhi se baaki sab kuch **sabit (prove)** karna.",
