            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **Geometry = geo (dharti) + metron (naapna).** Shuruaat zameen naapne se hui.\n- Geometry ki jhalak **Misr** (Nile ki baadh ke baad khet naapna), **Sindhu ghati** (eenton ka anupaat 4 : 2 : 1, seedhi sadkein), **Sulbasutras** (yagya ki vediyan) aur **Greece** (Thales, Pythagoras) mein milti hai.\n- **Euclid** (lagbhag 300 BCE, Alexandria) ne **Elements** likhi, jisme **13 books** hain. Unhe \"Father of Geometry\" kehte hain.\n- Euclid ka tarika: kuch baatein **bina proof** maano, baaki sab unse **prove** karo.\n- **Axiom:** har jagah kaam aane wali maani hui baat. **Postulate:** sirf geometry ki maani hui baat.\n- **7 axioms:** ek hi cheez ke barabar → barabar; barabar + barabar; barabar − barabar; coincide → barabar; poora > hissa; ek hi ke double → barabar; ek hi ke aadhe → barabar.\n- **5 postulates:** do points ko jodna; line badhana; circle banana; saare right angles barabar; parallel postulate.\n- **Paanchva postulate** ka aasan roop **Playfair's axiom** hai: line ke bahar ke point se sirf **ek** parallel line.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Geometry = geo (dharti) + metron (naapna).** Shuruaat zameen naapne se hui.\n- Geometry ki jhalak **Misr** (Nile ki baadh ke baad khet naapna), **Sindhu ghati** (eenton ka anupaat 4 : 2 : 1, seedhi sadkein), **Sulbasutras** (yagya ki vediyan) aur **Greece** (Thales, Pythagoras) mein milti hai.\n- **Euclid** (lagbhag 300 BCE, Alexandria) ne **Elements** likhi, jisme **13 books** hain. Unhe \"Father of Geometry\" kehte hain.\n- Euclid ka tarika: kuch baatein **bina proof** maano, baaki sab unse **prove** karo.\n- **Axiom:** har jagah kaam aane wali maani hui baat. **Postulate:** sirf geometry ki maani hui baat.\n- **7 axioms:** ek hi cheez ke barabar → barabar; barabar + barabar; barabar − barabar; coincide → barabar; poora > hissa; ek hi ke double → barabar; ek hi ke aadhe → barabar.\n- **5 postulates:** do points ko jodna; line badhana; circle banana; saare right angles barabar; parallel postulate.\n- **Paanchva postulate** ka aasan roop **Playfair's axiom** hai: line ke bahar ke point se sirf **ek** parallel line."
