            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne geometry ki kahani dekhi thi: kaise purane zamane mein log zameen naapte the, aur kaise Euclid ne saara gyaan ek kitaab (Elements) mein jod diya. Wahan humne ye bhi seekha ki **axioms aur postulates** wo baatein hain jinhe hum bina proof ke sach maan lete hain, aur Euclid ke 7 axioms aur 5 postulates dekhe.\n\nPar un postulates mein baar baar kuch shabd aate hain: **point, line, seedhi line, surface**. Ab sawal ye hai ki ye shabd asal mein hain kya? Euclid ne inki definition kaise di? Aur kya wo definitions sach mein kaam karti hain? Is topic mein hum yahi dekhenge, aur saath mein lines ke baare mein kuch pakke niyam (incidence axioms) seekhenge.",
