            "body": "Quadrilaterals chapter mein humne 4 sides wali figures dekhi thi: square, rectangle, rhombus, parallelogram, trapezium. Har ek mein 4 line segments aapas mein jud kar ek band figure banate the. Ab sawaal: agar sides 4 nahi, 5, 7 ya 20 hon, to? Is chapter mein hum **saari** aisi band, seedhi-seedhi figures ko ek saath samjhenge. Aur \"kitne sides\" ka naam kya hota hai, ye is pehle topic mein seekhenge.",
