            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne seekha tha ki compass aur ruler se kya-kya ho sakta hai: segment banana, use copy karna, perpendicular bisector kheenchna aur segment ko barabar hisson mein baantna. Wahan sab kuch **lengths** ka khel tha, jaise Omkar ne rassi ka bilkul beech dhoondh kar lantern latkaya tha. Ab hum **angles** ki taraf chalte hain: koi angle kaise banayein jab protractor na ho, kisi angle ko kaise aadha karein, aur kisi angle ki hu-ba-hu copy kaise banayein. Aur sab kuch wahi do auzaar se: compass aur ruler.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne seekha tha ki compass aur ruler se kya-kya ho sakta hai: segment banana, use copy karna, perpendicular bisector kheenchna aur segment ko barabar hisson mein baantna. Wahan sab kuch **lengths** ka khel tha, jaise Omkar ne rassi ka bilkul beech dhoondh kar lantern latkaya tha. Ab hum **angles** ki taraf chalte hain: koi angle kaise banayein jab protractor na ho, kisi angle ko kaise aadha karein, aur kisi angle ki hu-ba-hu copy kaise banayein. Aur sab kuch wahi do auzaar se: compass aur ruler."
