            "body": "Pichle topics mein humne seekha ki triangle kaafi \"sakht\" hota hai: teen sahi measurements (jaise SSS, SAS, ASA) mil jaayein to triangle ek hi ban sakta hai, aur do sides ka sum ya perimeter diya ho to bhi hum use bana lete the (jaise Mrs. Kulkarni ka 15 cm wala jhanda, jo equilateral nikla). Ab ek chaar-sides wali shape ki baari hai. Kya wahi 3 measurements kaafi honge? Nahi, aur aaj dekhenge ki kyun. Aur sabse achhi baat: har quadrilateral ko hum **triangles mein tod kar** banayenge, jo humein pehle se aata hai. Chapter ka aakhri topic hai, to end mein poore chapter ka wrap-up aur ek construction checklist bhi hoga.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichle topics mein humne seekha ki triangle kaafi \"sakht\" hota hai: teen sahi measurements (jaise SSS, SAS, ASA) mil jaayein to triangle ek hi ban sakta hai, aur do sides ka sum ya perimeter diya ho to bhi hum use bana lete the (jaise Mrs. Kulkarni ka 15 cm wala jhanda, jo equilateral nikla). Ab ek chaar-sides wali shape ki baari hai. Kya wahi 3 measurements kaafi honge? Nahi, aur aaj dekhenge ki kyun. Aur sabse achhi baat: har quadrilateral ko hum **triangles mein tod kar** banayenge, jo humein pehle se aata hai. Chapter ka aakhri topic hai, to end mein poore chapter ka wrap-up aur ek construction checklist bhi hoga."
