            "headingHinglish": "Ms. Joseph, Vinay aur diamond panel",
            "body": "Ms. Joseph school ke annual play ki stage backdrop designer hain. Is baar unhein ek bada **rhombus (diamond) wala panel** banana hai, aur ek **rectangle wala darwaza ka frame** bhi. Unka helper Vinay lakdi ki chaar patliyan (strips) le aaya, chaaron 5 cm ki (scale drawing mein), aur bola, \"Madam, chaaron sides barabar hain, bas jod do. Diamond ban jaayega.\"\n\nMs. Joseph ne chaaron strips ke kone keel se jode. Jab Vinay ne frame ko thoda dhakela, to wo kabhi lamba patla diamond ban gaya, kabhi chauda sa. Madam ne hanskar kaha, \"Dekha Vinay? Chaar sides ek hi kahani nahi sunaati. Frame **hil** jaata hai. Humein ek aur measurement chahiye: ek diagonal, ya ek angle.\"\n\nVinay ne kaha, \"To triangle ko 3 chahiye, aur quadrilateral ko 5?\" Madam ne kaha, \"Bilkul. Chalo dekhte hain kyun.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Ms. Joseph school ke annual play ki stage backdrop designer hain. Is baar unhein ek bada **rhombus (diamond) wala panel** banana hai, aur ek **rectangle wala darwaza ka frame** bhi. Unka helper Vinay lakdi ki chaar patliyan (strips) le aaya, chaaron 5 cm ki (scale drawing mein), aur bola, \"Madam, chaaron sides barabar hain, bas jod do. Diamond ban jaayega.\"\n\nMs. Joseph ne chaaron strips ke kone keel se jode. Jab Vinay ne frame ko thoda dhakela, to wo kabhi lamba patla diamond ban gaya, kabhi chauda sa. Madam ne hanskar kaha, \"Dekha Vinay? Chaar sides ek hi kahani nahi sunaati. Frame **hil** jaata hai. Humein ek aur measurement chahiye: ek diagonal, ya ek angle.\"\n\nVinay ne kaha, \"To triangle ko 3 chahiye, aur quadrilateral ko 5?\" Madam ne kaha, \"Bilkul. Chalo dekhte hain kyun.\""
