            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Hypotenuse (c)** | (Topic 1 se yaad) Right angle ke saamne wali side, hamesha sabse lambi | Seedhi: 10 m |\n| **Legs (a, b)** | (Topic 1 se yaad) Right angle banane wali do chhoti sides | Deewar 8 m, zameen 6 m |\n| **Square root (√)** | Wo number jiska square diya gaya number ho | √36 = 6 |\n| **Surd** | Aisa root jo poora number nahi hota, jaise √2. Simplify karke 5√2 jaisa likhte hain | √50 = 5√2 |\n| **Pythagorean triplet** | Teen whole numbers a, b, c jinke liye a² + b² = c² ho | 3, 4, 5 |\n| **Diagonal** | (Topic 1 se yaad, TV wali) Rectangle ke ek kone se saamne wale kone tak ki seedhi line | 40 m × 30 m field ka diagonal 50 m |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Hypotenuse (c)** | (Topic 1 se yaad) Right angle ke saamne wali side, hamesha sabse lambi | Seedhi: 10 m |\n| **Legs (a, b)** | (Topic 1 se yaad) Right angle banane wali do chhoti sides | Deewar 8 m, zameen 6 m |\n| **Square root (√)** | Wo number jiska square diya gaya number ho | √36 = 6 |\n| **Surd** | Aisa root jo poora number nahi hota, jaise √2. Simplify karke 5√2 jaisa likhte hain | √50 = 5√2 |\n| **Pythagorean triplet** | Teen whole numbers a, b, c jinke liye a² + b² = c² ho | 3, 4, 5 |\n| **Diagonal** | (Topic 1 se yaad, TV wali) Rectangle ke ek kone se saamne wale kone tak ki seedhi line | 40 m × 30 m field ka diagonal 50 m |"
