            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne distance formula ko ek \"jaasoos\" ki tarah use kiya: sirf coordinates dekh kar bata diya ki triangle isosceles hai, right-angled hai, ya square hai. Meghna ke plaza ke lamp-posts (1, 0), (3, 1), (2, 3), (0, 2) tirchhe dikhte the, par chaaron sides √5 aur dono diagonals √10 nikle, to Farooq ko saboot mil gaya ki wo square hai. Wahan hamein **teen ya chaar points diye hue** the aur unki shape pehchanni thi.\n\nAb kahaani ulti chalegi. Ab kabhi sawaal hoga \"kya ye teen points ek hi seedhi line par hain?\", kabhi \"wo point dhoondho jo in do (ya teen) points se **barabar door** ho\", aur kabhi \"kisi point ka ek coordinate gaayab hai, wo nikalo\". Teeno sawaal ek hi aukaat par khade hain: **doori ka formula**, aur kabhi-kabhi uska **square**."
