            "headingHinglish": "Gauri bakri ki kahani",
            "body": "Gaon mein Meena ke paas ek bakri hai, naam hai **Gauri**. Har subah Meena use maidan mein le jati hai aur ek **khoonta** (lakdi ka khoonta) zameen mein gaad deti hai. Gauri ko **7 metre lambi rassi** se us khoonte se baandh deti hai.\n\nAb Gauri din bhar ghaas charti hai. Shaam ko Meena dekhti hai ki maidan mein ek **gol nishaan** ban gaya hai:\n\n- Khoonte ke paas ki saari ghaas khatam ho gayi.\n- Ek hadd tak ghaas chari hui hai, uske baad ghaas bilkul waisi hi hai.\n- Wo hadd ekdam **gol** hai.\n\nKyun? Kyunki Gauri khoonte se **7 metre se zyada door ja hi nahi sakti.** Jab wo rassi poori kheench kar ghoomti hai, to har jagah khoonte se theek **7 metre** door hoti hai. Aise saare points mil kar ek **circle** banate hain.\n\nIs kahani mein:\n- **Khoonta** = circle ka **centre** (kendra)\n- **Rassi ki lambai (7 m)** = circle ka **radius** (trijya)\n- **Gol hadd** = **circle**\n- **Andar ki chari hui ghaas** = circle ka **interior** (andar wala hissa)\n- **Bahar ki ghaas** jahan Gauri nahi pahunch sakti = circle ka **exterior** (bahar wala hissa)\n\nIs topic mein hum yahi sab shabd aaram se samjhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Gaon mein Meena ke paas ek bakri hai, naam hai **Gauri**. Har subah Meena use maidan mein le jati hai aur ek **khoonta** (lakdi ka khoonta) zameen mein gaad deti hai. Gauri ko **7 metre lambi rassi** se us khoonte se baandh deti hai.\n\nAb Gauri din bhar ghaas charti hai. Shaam ko Meena dekhti hai ki maidan mein ek **gol nishaan** ban gaya hai:\n\n- Khoonte ke paas ki saari ghaas khatam ho gayi.\n- Ek hadd tak ghaas chari hui hai, uske baad ghaas bilkul waisi hi hai.\n- Wo hadd ekdam **gol** hai.\n\nKyun? Kyunki Gauri khoonte se **7 metre se zyada door ja hi nahi sakti.** Jab wo rassi poori kheench kar ghoomti hai, to har jagah khoonte se theek **7 metre** door hoti hai. Aise saare points mil kar ek **circle** banate hain.\n\nIs kahani mein:\n- **Khoonta** = circle ka **centre** (kendra)\n- **Rassi ki lambai (7 m)** = circle ka **radius** (trijya)\n- **Gol hadd** = **circle**\n- **Andar ki chari hui ghaas** = circle ka **interior** (andar wala hissa)\n- **Bahar ki ghaas** jahan Gauri nahi pahunch sakti = circle ka **exterior** (bahar wala hissa)\n\nIs topic mein hum yahi sab shabd aaram se samjhenge."
