            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Circle (vritt)** | Ek plane mein un saare points ka samooh jo ek fix point se barabar doori par hon | Gauri ki gol hadd, chudi ka kinaara |\n| **Centre (kendra)** | Wo fix point jisse circle ke saare points barabar door hain | Khoonta |\n| **Radius (trijya)** | Centre se circle ke kisi point tak ki doori (aur wo line segment bhi) | Rassi, 7 m |\n| **Chord (jeeva)** | Circle ke kinhi do points ko jodne wala line segment | Roti par chaaku se seedha cut |\n| **Diameter (vyas)** | Wo chord jo centre se guzarti hai; lambai = 2 × radius | Roti ko theek beech se aadha karna |\n| **Arc (chaap)** | Circle ka ek tukda (curve wala hissa) | Chudi ka toota hua tukda |\n| **Circumference (paridhi)** | Circle ke chaaron taraf ki poori lambai | Gauri ki hadd ka ek poora chakkar |\n| **Interior / Exterior** | Circle ke andar ka / bahar ka hissa | Chari hui ghaas / bachi hui ghaas |\n| **Segment** | Chord aur arc ke beech ka hissa | Roti ka seedha kata hua tukda |\n| **Sector** | Do radius aur arc ke beech ka hissa | Roti ka kone wala tukda (centre se) |\n| **Semicircle (ardhvritt)** | Diameter se bana aadha circle | Aadhi roti |\n| **Secant** | Wo line jo circle ko do points par kaatti hai | Roti ke aar-paar jaata seekh |\n| **Tangent (sparsh rekha)** | Wo line jo circle ko sirf ek point par chhooti hai | Zameen jahan cycle ka pahiya chhoota hai |\n| **Concentric circles** | Ek hi centre wale, alag alag radius ke circles | Talaab mein pathar phenkne par bani lehrein |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Circle (vritt)** | Ek plane mein un saare points ka samooh jo ek fix point se barabar doori par hon | Gauri ki gol hadd, chudi ka kinaara |\n| **Centre (kendra)** | Wo fix point jisse circle ke saare points barabar door hain | Khoonta |\n| **Radius (trijya)** | Centre se circle ke kisi point tak ki doori (aur wo line segment bhi) | Rassi, 7 m |\n| **Chord (jeeva)** | Circle ke kinhi do points ko jodne wala line segment | Roti par chaaku se seedha cut |\n| **Diameter (vyas)** | Wo chord jo centre se guzarti hai; lambai = 2 × radius | Roti ko theek beech se aadha karna |\n| **Arc (chaap)** | Circle ka ek tukda (curve wala hissa) | Chudi ka toota hua tukda |\n| **Circumference (paridhi)** | Circle ke chaaron taraf ki poori lambai | Gauri ki hadd ka ek poora chakkar |\n| **Interior / Exterior** | Circle ke andar ka / bahar ka hissa | Chari hui ghaas / bachi hui ghaas |\n| **Segment** | Chord aur arc ke beech ka hissa | Roti ka seedha kata hua tukda |\n| **Sector** | Do radius aur arc ke beech ka hissa | Roti ka kone wala tukda (centre se) |\n| **Semicircle (ardhvritt)** | Diameter se bana aadha circle | Aadhi roti |\n| **Secant** | Wo line jo circle ko do points par kaatti hai | Roti ke aar-paar jaata seekh |\n| **Tangent (sparsh rekha)** | Wo line jo circle ko sirf ek point par chhooti hai | Zameen jahan cycle ka pahiya chhoota hai |\n| **Concentric circles** | Ek hi centre wale, alag alag radius ke circles | Talaab mein pathar phenkne par bani lehrein |"
