            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne Gauri bakri ke khoonte (centre) aur 7 m ki rassi (radius) se circle se dosti ki thi. Centre, radius, diameter, chord jaise shabd seekhe, arc ka basic idea dekha, segment aur sector ki ek jhalak li, aur ye bhi samjha ki koi point circle ke andar hai, us par hai, ya bahar.\n\nAb hum **arc** ko zoom karke dekhenge. Ek arc kitna \"bada\" hai, ise kaise naapte hain? Kaunsa arc chhota (minor) hai, kaunsa bada (major)? Aur jab ek chord circle ko do hisson mein kaatti hai, to wo do hisse ek doosre ke liye kya kehlate hain?",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne Gauri bakri ke khoonte (centre) aur 7 m ki rassi (radius) se circle se dosti ki thi. Centre, radius, diameter, chord jaise shabd seekhe, arc ka basic idea dekha, segment aur sector ki ek jhalak li, aur ye bhi samjha ki koi point circle ke andar hai, us par hai, ya bahar.\n\nAb hum **arc** ko zoom karke dekhenge. Ek arc kitna \"bada\" hai, ise kaise naapte hain? Kaunsa arc chhota (minor) hai, kaunsa bada (major)? Aur jab ek chord circle ko do hisson mein kaatti hai, to wo do hisse ek doosre ke liye kya kehlate hain?"
