            "headingHinglish": "Mele ka giant wheel",
            "body": "Pinky apne papa ke saath mele mein gayi. Wahan ek bada **giant wheel** tha, jisme **12 cabin** barabar doori par lage the.\n\nPinky cabin number 1 mein baithi. Wheel ghoomna shuru hua. Pinky ne papa se poocha:\n\n\"Papa, jab main cabin 4 ki jagah tak pahunchungi, to maine wheel ka kitna hissa ghoom liya?\"\n\nPapa ne samjhaya:\n\n\"Pura wheel ek chakkar mein **360°** ghoomta hai. 12 cabin barabar doori par hain, to do paas wale cabins ke beech ka angle hai 360° ÷ 12 = **30°**. Cabin 1 se cabin 4 tak 3 gap hain, to tum **3 × 30° = 90°** ghoomogi. Yaani wheel ka ek chauthai hissa.\"\n\nPinky ne phir poocha, \"Aur cabin 7 tak?\"\n\n\"6 gap, yaani 6 × 30° = **180°**. Ye theek aadha chakkar hai. Tab tum bilkul upar wale hisse mein hogi, jahan se chadhi thi uske theek saamne.\"\n\nPinky ne jo raasta circle ke kinare par tay kiya, wo ek **arc** hai. Aur papa ne us arc ko **degree** mein naapa. Is topic mein hum yahi seekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pinky apne papa ke saath mele mein gayi. Wahan ek bada **giant wheel** tha, jisme **12 cabin** barabar doori par lage the.\n\nPinky cabin number 1 mein baithi. Wheel ghoomna shuru hua. Pinky ne papa se poocha:\n\n\"Papa, jab main cabin 4 ki jagah tak pahunchungi, to maine wheel ka kitna hissa ghoom liya?\"\n\nPapa ne samjhaya:\n\n\"Pura wheel ek chakkar mein **360°** ghoomta hai. 12 cabin barabar doori par hain, to do paas wale cabins ke beech ka angle hai 360° ÷ 12 = **30°**. Cabin 1 se cabin 4 tak 3 gap hain, to tum **3 × 30° = 90°** ghoomogi. Yaani wheel ka ek chauthai hissa.\"\n\nPinky ne phir poocha, \"Aur cabin 7 tak?\"\n\n\"6 gap, yaani 6 × 30° = **180°**. Ye theek aadha chakkar hai. Tab tum bilkul upar wale hisse mein hogi, jahan se chadhi thi uske theek saamne.\"\n\nPinky ne jo raasta circle ke kinare par tay kiya, wo ek **arc** hai. Aur papa ne us arc ko **degree** mein naapa. Is topic mein hum yahi seekhenge."
