            "body": "Topic 1 aur 2 mein humne **flat (sapaat) shapes** ka area nikala. Pehle triangle ka area, jab height na pata ho tab bhi, Heron's formula se (Sameer ka 13-14-15 wala traffic island). Phir quadrilateral ka area, use ek diagonal se do triangles mein tod kar (Nisha ka kitchen garden aur Verma sir ka hilne wala frame). Ye sab shapes kaagaz par bichhi hui thin: inme sirf lambai aur chaudai thi.\n\nAb hum kaagaz se uth kar **asli duniya ki cheezon** par aate hain, jinme ek teesri cheez bhi hoti hai: **unchai (height)**. Dabba, eent, kamra, paani ki tanki: ye sab **3D (teen dimension wale) solids** hain. Is topic mein hum sabse aasan do solids se shuru karenge: **cuboid** aur **cube**.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 aur 2 mein humne **flat (sapaat) shapes** ka area nikala. Pehle triangle ka area, jab height na pata ho tab bhi, Heron's formula se (Sameer ka 13-14-15 wala traffic island). Phir quadrilateral ka area, use ek diagonal se do triangles mein tod kar (Nisha ka kitchen garden aur Verma sir ka hilne wala frame). Ye sab shapes kaagaz par bichhi hui thin: inme sirf lambai aur chaudai thi.\n\nAb hum kaagaz se uth kar **asli duniya ki cheezon** par aate hain, jinme ek teesri cheez bhi hoti hai: **unchai (height)**. Dabba, eent, kamra, paani ki tanki: ye sab **3D (teen dimension wale) solids** hain. Is topic mein hum sabse aasan do solids se shuru karenge: **cuboid** aur **cube**."
