            "body": "Topic 4 mein Aarav ne tin ka label khol kar dekha tha ki cylinder ki gol deewar ek rectangle ban jaati hai. Wahan humne cylinder ko achhe se samjha tha: gol base, seedhi deewar, aur uski curved surface ka area 2πrh, poora surface 2πr(r + h), aur volume πr²h. Ab us cylinder ka ek \"nukeela bhai\" aata hai. Iska base bhi gol hai, par upar jaate jaate ye patla hota jata hai aur ek point par khatam ho jata hai. Ise **cone** kehte hain. Cylinder wali kaafi baatein yahan kaam aayengi, khaas kar volume mein.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 4 mein Aarav ne tin ka label khol kar dekha tha ki cylinder ki gol deewar ek rectangle ban jaati hai. Wahan humne cylinder ko achhe se samjha tha: gol base, seedhi deewar, aur uski curved surface ka area 2πrh, poora surface 2πr(r + h), aur volume πr²h. Ab us cylinder ka ek \"nukeela bhai\" aata hai. Iska base bhi gol hai, par upar jaate jaate ye patla hota jata hai aur ek point par khatam ho jata hai. Ise **cone** kehte hain. Cylinder wali kaafi baatein yahan kaam aayengi, khaas kar volume mein."
