            "body": "Wahi Golu, jiski birthday party Topic 5 mein dekhi thi! Is baar uski football phat gayi. Wo use lekar gali ke kone wale **mochi chacha** ke paas gaya.\n\nChacha ne football ko ghuma kar dekha aur bole, \"Beta, poora naya chamda (leather) chadhana padega. Pehle naapna padega ki **kitna chamda** lagega.\"\n\nGolu ne poocha, \"Chacha, aur andar kitni hawa jaayegi?\"\n\nChacha hans pade. \"Wo alag sawaal hai beta. Chamda to **upar ki sataha** (surface) ka hisaab hai, aur hawa **andar ki jagah** (volume) ka.\"\n\nGhar aakar Golu ne dekha ki mummy dal ek **katori** mein rakh rahi hain. Katori bhi gol thi, par sirf aadhi. \"Ye to aadhi football jaisi hai!\" usne socha.\n\nGolu ke teen sawaal hi is topic ki poori kahani hain:\n1. Gol cheez ke **upar** kitna chamda lagta hai? (Surface area)\n2. Gol cheez ke **andar** kitni jagah hoti hai? (Volume)\n3. Aadhi gol cheez (katori) ka kya hisaab hai? (Hemisphere)",
            "bodyHinglish": "Wahi Golu, jiski birthday party Topic 5 mein dekhi thi! Is baar uski football phat gayi. Wo use lekar gali ke kone wale **mochi chacha** ke paas gaya.\n\nChacha ne football ko ghuma kar dekha aur bole, \"Beta, poora naya chamda (leather) chadhana padega. Pehle naapna padega ki **kitna chamda** lagega.\"\n\nGolu ne poocha, \"Chacha, aur andar kitni hawa jaayegi?\"\n\nChacha hans pade. \"Wo alag sawaal hai beta. Chamda to **upar ki sataha** (surface) ka hisaab hai, aur hawa **andar ki jagah** (volume) ka.\"\n\nGhar aakar Golu ne dekha ki mummy dal ek **katori** mein rakh rahi hain. Katori bhi gol thi, par sirf aadhi. \"Ye to aadhi football jaisi hai!\" usne socha.\n\nGolu ke teen sawaal hi is topic ki poori kahani hain:\n1. Gol cheez ke **upar** kitna chamda lagta hai? (Surface area)\n2. Gol cheez ke **andar** kitni jagah hoti hai? (Volume)\n3. Aadhi gol cheez (katori) ka kya hisaab hai? (Hemisphere)"
