            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Sphere** | Aisi 3D cheez jiska har point centre se barabar doori par ho | Football, kancha (marble), globe |\n| **Centre** | Sphere ke bilkul beech ka point | Football ke andar ka beech wala point |\n| **Radius (r)** | Centre se surface tak ki doori | Football ka radius 10.5 cm |\n| **Diameter (d)** | Centre se hokar ek taraf se doosri taraf tak ki doori, d = 2r | 21 cm wali football |\n| **Hemisphere** | Sphere ka bilkul aadha hissa (centre se kaatne par) | Katori, gumbad (dome) |\n| **Curved Surface Area (CSA)** | Sirf gol, mudi hui sataha ka area | Katori ki andar wali sataha |\n| **Total Surface Area (TSA)** | Saari sataha: mudi hui + sapaat (flat) | Thos (solid) aadhi gend ka poora bahar |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Sphere** | Aisi 3D cheez jiska har point centre se barabar doori par ho | Football, kancha (marble), globe |\n| **Centre** | Sphere ke bilkul beech ka point | Football ke andar ka beech wala point |\n| **Radius (r)** | Centre se surface tak ki doori | Football ka radius 10.5 cm |\n| **Diameter (d)** | Centre se hokar ek taraf se doosri taraf tak ki doori, d = 2r | 21 cm wali football |\n| **Hemisphere** | Sphere ka bilkul aadha hissa (centre se kaatne par) | Katori, gumbad (dome) |\n| **Curved Surface Area (CSA)** | Sirf gol, mudi hui sataha ka area | Katori ki andar wali sataha |\n| **Total Surface Area (TSA)** | Saari sataha: mudi hui + sapaat (flat) | Thos (solid) aadhi gend ka poora bahar |"
