            "explanation": "Points go at the class mark, not at the class limits. Class mark = (40 + 50)/2 = 45, so the point is (45, 12). Plotting at 40 or 50 shifts the whole polygon by half a class.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Point class mark par lagta hai, class limits par nahi. Class mark = (40 + 50)/2 = 45, to point (45, 12) hai. 40 ya 50 par lagaya to poora polygon aadhi class khisak jayega."
