            "question": "A table has 10–20 (f = 8), 20–40 (f = 14) and 40–50 (f = 6). A histogram is drawn with width 10 as the standard, and the polygon is drawn from it. Where is the point for the class 20–40?",
            "questionHinglish": "Table mein 10–20 (f = 8), 20–40 (f = 14) aur 40–50 (f = 6) hain. Width 10 ko standard maan kar histogram bana, aur usi se polygon. Class 20–40 ka point kahan hoga?",
