            "id": "q-stat-u4-8",
            "question": "Two data sets are drawn as frequency polygons on the same axes. At class marks 15, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65 the first set has frequencies 6, 10, 14, 12, 8, 4 and the second has 12, 9, 7, 8, 11, 13. At which class mark is the gap between the two polygons the largest?",
            "questionHinglish": "Do data sets ek hi axes par frequency polygon ke roop mein bane hain. Class marks 15, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65 par pehle set ki frequencies 6, 10, 14, 12, 8, 4 hain aur doosre ki 12, 9, 7, 8, 11, 13. Kis class mark par dono polygons ke beech ka farak sabse bada hai?",
