            "explanationHinglish": "Padosi midpoints ko jodne wali line ek bar se chhota triangle kaat deti hai aur bagal mein utna hi bada (congruent) triangle jod deti hai. Isliye polygon ke neeche ka area histogram ke area ke barabar hota hai. Sabse ooncha point class mark ke upar hota hai, shuruaat pehli khayali class mark se hoti hai, aur ek graph par kai data sets aa sakte hain."
