            "body": "Is chapter mein hum **chance** ko maths ki nazar se dekhna seekhenge: \"shayad ho jayega\" jaisi baat ko ek **number** mein badalna. Pehle topic mein koi calculation nahi hogi. Bas ye samajhna hai ki chance ki baat karte waqt humein kaun-kaun se shabd chahiye, aur kaunsi cheezein \"random\" kehlati hain. Zero se shuru kar rahe hain, to koi tension nahi.",
