            "explanation": "Interest per year = ₹1,000. To earn ₹10,000 of interest we need 10,000 / 1,000 = 10 years. Under compound interest the doubling takes noticeably fewer years, since interest keeps earning interest.",
            "explanationHinglish": "Ek saal ka byaaj ₹1,000. ₹10,000 byaaj kamane ke liye 10,000 / 1,000 = 10 saal chahiye. Compound interest mein byaaj par byaaj milne se paisa kaafi kam saal mein dugna ho jata hai."
