            "body": "Pichle topic mein humne compound interest ko **saal-dar-saal table** banakar nikala tha (jaise Harpreet ji ke ₹50,000 ke trolley loan ki table, jo 2 saal mein ₹58,320 ho gaya): har saal ka interest alag nikalo, use principal mein jodo, phir agle saal ke liye wahi kaam dobara. 2-3 saal tak ye theek chala. Par socho, agar 10 saal ya 20 saal ka sawaal aa jaye to? Table ki 10 ya 20 rows banani padengi, aur har row mein ek chhoti si galti poora jawab bigaad sakti hai.\n\nIs topic mein hum us lambe tareeke ko **ek line ke formula** mein badalenge. Aur sabse achhi baat: ye formula wahi cheez hai jo table baar-baar kar rahi thi, bas use ek baar mein likh diya gaya hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichle topic mein humne compound interest ko **saal-dar-saal table** banakar nikala tha (jaise Harpreet ji ke ₹50,000 ke trolley loan ki table, jo 2 saal mein ₹58,320 ho gaya): har saal ka interest alag nikalo, use principal mein jodo, phir agle saal ke liye wahi kaam dobara. 2-3 saal tak ye theek chala. Par socho, agar 10 saal ya 20 saal ka sawaal aa jaye to? Table ki 10 ya 20 rows banani padengi, aur har row mein ek chhoti si galti poora jawab bigaad sakti hai.\n\nIs topic mein hum us lambe tareeke ko **ek line ke formula** mein badalenge. Aur sabse achhi baat: ye formula wahi cheez hai jo table baar-baar kar rahi thi, bas use ek baar mein likh diya gaya hai."
