            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 2 mein humne logarithm ke saath kaafi khel liya: exponential form se log form mein jaana, wapas aana, value, argument ya base dhoondhna, aur fractions aur negative logs (jaise log₂ (1/8) = −3) tak pahunchna. Rhea aur Manav ne isi tarah escape room ki teen plates kholi thi (code 3, 3 aur 2/3). Wahan har baar hum ek hi log ko dekh rahe the. Ab sawaal ye hai: **agar ek hi expression mein do ya teen logs ek saath hon, to unka kya karein?** Kya unhe jod sakte hain, ghata sakte hain? Is topic mein isi ke niyam milenge, aur ye niyam logarithm ki asli taakat hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 2 mein humne logarithm ke saath kaafi khel liya: exponential form se log form mein jaana, wapas aana, value, argument ya base dhoondhna, aur fractions aur negative logs (jaise log₂ (1/8) = −3) tak pahunchna. Rhea aur Manav ne isi tarah escape room ki teen plates kholi thi (code 3, 3 aur 2/3). Wahan har baar hum ek hi log ko dekh rahe the. Ab sawaal ye hai: **agar ek hi expression mein do ya teen logs ek saath hon, to unka kya karein?** Kya unhe jod sakte hain, ghata sakte hain? Is topic mein isi ke niyam milenge, aur ye niyam logarithm ki asli taakat hain."
