            "explanationHinglish": "Dono taraf log: n × log 1.1 = log 5. Power law n ko neeche guna bana deta hai, isliye n nikalne ke liye bhaag dete hain: n = log 5 ÷ log 1.1. 5 ÷ 1.1 mein log hi nahi lage, aur baaki do mein galat operation hai."
