            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Trigonometric ratio** | Right triangle ki do sides ka ratio, kisi ek acute angle ke hisaab se | Opposite ÷ adjacent |\n| **sin θ** (sine) | Opposite ÷ hypotenuse | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 3/5 |\n| **cos θ** (cosine) | Adjacent ÷ hypotenuse | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 4/5 |\n| **tan θ** (tangent) | Opposite ÷ adjacent | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 3/4 |\n| **θ (theta)** | Ek angle ka naam, jaise hum \"x\" ek number ko kehte hain | ∠A = θ |\n| **SOH-CAH-TOA** | Teeno ratios yaad rakhne ka ek chhota sa trick | Neeche Part A mein |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Trigonometric ratio** | Right triangle ki do sides ka ratio, kisi ek acute angle ke hisaab se | Opposite ÷ adjacent |\n| **sin θ** (sine) | Opposite ÷ hypotenuse | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 3/5 |\n| **cos θ** (cosine) | Adjacent ÷ hypotenuse | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 4/5 |\n| **tan θ** (tangent) | Opposite ÷ adjacent | 3-4-5 mein angle A ke liye 3/4 |\n| **θ (theta)** | Ek angle ka naam, jaise hum \"x\" ek number ko kehte hain | ∠A = θ |\n| **SOH-CAH-TOA** | Teeno ratios yaad rakhne ka ek chhota sa trick | Neeche Part A mein |"
